[00:00.74]O Jehovah, you have given us
[00:07.48]a hope that we hold dear.
[00:15.96]It’s a hope we find so thrilling
[00:23.44]we want the world to hear.
[00:30.34]But at times this life’s anxieties
[00:37.69]are the cause of fears within,
[00:44.98]And the hope that burned so brightly
[00:54.16]has suddenly grown dim.
[01:01.53](Chorus)
[01:01.68]You’re our strength, you’re our hope,
[01:05.41]you’re our confidence.
[01:09.72]Whatever we lack, you supply.
[01:16.84]When we preach, when we teach,
[01:20.64]we have confidence
[01:25.08]because it’s on you we rely.
[01:34.96]So Jehovah, please instill in us
[01:44.40]a heart that won’t forget,
[01:52.14]For you’ve always been our comfort
[02:00.54]when troubled times we’ve met.
[02:07.36]And these thoughts that lift and strengthen us
[02:14.99]can revive that dying flame,
[02:22.94]For they fill our hearts with courage
[02:30.33]to speak about your name.
[02:38.53](Chorus)
[02:38.68]You’re our strength, you’re our hope,
[02:42.57]you’re our confidence.
[02:46.98]Whatever we lack, you supply.
[02:53.94]When we preach, when we teach,
[02:57.76]we have confidence
[03:02.20]because it’s on you we rely.
